      hu: "Keszong a Korjo Birodalom fővárosa volt, ma pedig a demilitarizált övezet közelében, a dél-koreai határnál fekszik.",
      ro: "Kaesong a fost capitala regatului Koryo, situată astăzi aproape de Zona Demilitarizată la granița cu Coreea de Sud.",
      en: "Kaesong was the capital of the Koryo kingdom, today located near the Demilitarized Zone at the South Korean border."
